Package: tuxedo-rust-center
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: TuxedoRustCenter contributors <maintainers@tuxedorustcenter.invalid>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6 (>= 13), libqt6core6t64 | libqt6core6, libqt6gui6, libqt6widgets6, libqt6qml6, libqt6quick6, libqt6quickcontrols2-6, libqt6quicktemplates2-6, libqt6svg6, qt6-svg-plugins | libqt6svg6, qt6-qpa-plugins, qml6-module-qtcore, qml6-module-qt-labs-platform, qml6-module-qt-labs-settings, qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-dialogs, qml6-module-qt5compat-graphicaleffects, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-shapes, qml6-module-qtquick-templates, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-models, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript
Recommends: tuxedo-drivers | tuxedo-keyboard, power-profiles-daemon, upower, polkitd, hicolor-icon-theme
Suggests: tuxedo-tomte, tuxedo-systeminfos, prime-select, switcheroo-control, nvidia-driver, kscreen
Conflicts: tuxedo-control-center, tuxedofancontrol
Replaces: tuxedo-control-center, tuxedofancontrol
Provides: tuxedo-control-center
Homepage: https://github.com/fnyaker/TuxedoRustCenter
Description: native Qt 6 TUXEDO Control Center rewrite
 TuxedoRustCenter is a 100% Rust rewrite of the TUXEDO Control Center,
 with a native Qt 6 GUI, a privileged Rust daemon and an unprivileged
 session agent.
 .
 Features include:
  * hardware profiles for CPU limits, fans, display, webcam and charging;
  * automatic profile switching from power-profiles-daemon and the
    AC/battery state;
  * internal display refresh rate per profile on X11 and Wayland;
  * system dashboard with temperatures, power and fan speeds.
 .
 The package installs no file under /opt and requires no Node/Python
 runtime.
